{"name": "Arcane Arena Survivors", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcane Arena Survivors</strong> is a fast-paced roguelike horde-survivor set in a grand magical arena. Wield powerful spells, battle endless waves, and impress the roaring crowd as you grow stronger each run. Defeat mighty champions and prove yourself as the ultimate master of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"205\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/89c9e23fdf3dd73c3689021fff4bdc23.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"959\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter high-intensity arena battles where relentless enemies test your survival. Take on evolving challenges, overcome powerful foes, and earn legendary rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/44f683ec6470d19e62f61d06aad59db1.poster.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"942\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/44f683ec6470d19e62f61d06aad59db1.webm?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/44f683ec6470d19e62f61d06aad59db1.mp4?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"205\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/97d53a4584ecc0dbacb70a7613f2a8ea.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"959\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a roster of powerful mages, each wielding unique spells, abilities, and magical weapons. Mix and match combinations to refine your builds and conquer the challenges of the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"558\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/0709b5be86be20fcfa8a47d654234335.poster.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/0709b5be86be20fcfa8a47d654234335.webm?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/0709b5be86be20fcfa8a47d654234335.mp4?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"205\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/f004092f09f30dc1a5f6f36b64fafe40.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"959\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash powerful ultimates that turn the tide of battle, delivering devastating bursts of magic to clear waves and crush even the toughest foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"558\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/4f6e43baf18b875f93098d3e8c574ab0.poster.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/4f6e43baf18b875f93098d3e8c574ab0.webm?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/4f6e43baf18b875f93098d3e8c574ab0.mp4?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"205\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/3886e6fd3f6efa59938e731b4fa3dd80.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"959\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on escalating boss battles as you advance through the arena. Use your magic, movement, and strategy to overcome these powerful foes and emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/eb777ea5e40f7e6f2e770f20f96bf560.poster.avif?t=1782837180\" width=\"904\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/eb777ea5e40f7e6f2e770f20f96bf560.webm?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/extras/eb777ea5e40f7e6f2e770f20f96bf560.mp4?t=1782837180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Arcane Arena Survivors is a fast-paced roguelike horde-survivor set in a grand magical arena. Wield powerful spells, battle endless waves, defeat mighty champions and prove yourself as the ultimate master of magic.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565190/fa81d0c922d081121423ce0f3d1d34a130d59b71/header.jpg?t=1782837180", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Casual", "Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "3D", "RPG"], "developers": "Dajo Forge", "publishers": "Dajo Forge", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4565190", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/AVk1BCQh6t4", "first_seen": 1780696800.0, "review_rank": 460}